{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t10.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/t10.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t10_orien_01_01",
      "hash64": "25E39EB0138CAF26",
      "text": "這裡是翠綠鎮，\\n以大自然和蘋果出名喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t10_orien_05_01",
      "hash64": "21F8B68CBD2F7E6A",
      "text": "聽說[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是從海外來這裡參加\\n夏令營的啊？難怪我沒看過[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t10_orien_07_01",
      "hash64": "4F266A9FA3168BC8",
      "text": "來得及準備嗎？\\n在慶典要賣的東西，遲遲沒出貨呢……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t10_orien_08_01",
      "hash64": "1D815A75E9DD7DE3",
      "text": "最近我啊，\\n每天都在家練習做炒麵喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t10_orien_09_01",
      "hash64": "46B96E6A9F602D8E",
      "text": "桃澤商店很方便滴唷！\\n道具就不用說了！\\c\\n連那間店的老奶奶自己織的\\n暖暖襪，也都能買到喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t10_orien_11_01",
      "hash64": "397CD68925BE6D2D",
      "text": "從這前面上去就是北上中心了！\\n山路還挺長的，要加油喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t10_orien_14_01",
      "hash64": "E76F12A4E10EE254",
      "text": "蚊香蝌蚪的肚子！\\n看著看著我眼睛就花了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t10_orien_23_01",
      "hash64": "417D725FAC2A9B6E",
      "text": "丹瑜跟烏栗他們都是去到了\\n海外的學園讀書呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t10_orien_24_01",
      "hash64": "965A2A559CC188E5",
      "text": "那對常惹事的姊弟，\\n我聽說他們回來啦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t10_orien_28_01",
      "hash64": "D061E2B97FAA71F9",
      "text": "田裡面的稻子成熟後，\\n就能脫穀精製成大米……白米喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t10_orien_32_01",
      "hash64": "029C465479509FDC",
      "text": "把米飯夾在三明治裡！？\\n在北上沒聽過這種吃法呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t10_orien_34_01",
      "hash64": "26408A20B10AA762",
      "text": "這村子什麼也沒有吧？\\n就是這點才好呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_01_01",
      "hash64": "FAD7B0A01478F42E",
      "text": "這裡是翠綠鎮。\\n掩面祭很有名喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_01",
      "hash64": "9EB4A881A4A8A392",
      "text": "青年團體的大家都在炒熱祭典的氣氛，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就好好享受吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_02",
      "hash64": "9EB4A781A4A8A1DF",
      "text": "我在北上中心\\n看到寶伴了！！\\r\\n牠們吃了好多北上糬！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_05_03",
      "hash64": "9EB4A681A4A8A02C",
      "text": "我聽說有個孩子\\n跟厄鬼椪變得很要好！\\r\\n……難不成是烏栗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_01",
      "hash64": "22675C8FA29105F0",
      "text": "我喜歡夠讚狗！\\n牠那綠色實在有夠酷～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_02",
      "hash64": "22675F8FA2910B09",
      "text": "夠讚狗的本尊！\\n牠沒有面具那麼綠喔！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_07_03",
      "hash64": "22675E8FA2910956",
      "text": "厄鬼椪本尊和面具\\n都是綠色的，實在有夠酷！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_11_01",
      "hash64": "B77F487E0E4D2E75",
      "text": "水果糖攤的糖蘋果！\\c\\n那是用蘋果之丘現摘的蘋果\\n整顆下去做的喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t10_matsuri_15_01",
      "hash64": "917810A02B06E331",
      "text": "「掩面」也有用面具遮臉的意思，\\n所以掩面祭才會戴面具嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_01",
      "hash64": "1D998FA71A46F924",
      "text": "麻吉麻吉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_03",
      "hash64": "1D9991A71A46FC8A",
      "text": "麻、麻吉、麻、麻吉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_t10_zombie_npc_05",
      "hash64": "1D998BA71A46F258",
      "text": "麻吉麻吉……\\n麻……吉……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
